    "message": "[ipa-delivery:726] build(delivery): private IPA 726, second request (first run orphaned by a GitHub Actions outage) = the delivered 725 with RPCS3 Core 933, MeloNX Core 735, PRs 172/176/177, the Switch 2 library layer and the 725 message fixes\n\nFrozen on 8fb2ee39 (effective digest 27f4a0f0, unchanged from the first\nrequest, 7755 product files, legal check of the effective tree passed).\nThe run of the first trigger 0fbb5ac8 (43098367088) was created at\n20:50:19 UTC during a GitHub Actions outage and never started; GitHub\nrefused its cancellation (409, not queued yet). Base: the delivered and\nverified 725 (run 42973548971). Replaced: RPCS3 Core 933 (pin 3fdc9f3b),\nMeloNX Core 735 (pin 3939c7a9). Retained: Dolphin, ARMSX2, libretro\narchive, MeloNX dependencies, standalone MoltenVK 99605a2b. Added image:\nxenia_internal_bridge.framework. Fresh Flutter (25 commands) and native\n(22 commands) groups. Nothing of this build has been run on an iPhone.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012mUAShv9k6pSCnpW7oAF63",
